OL,3,AGovernment condemns 'thuggish'
OL,4,Abehaviour in Portsmouth after second
OL,5,Asmall boats protest of weekend
OL,6,
OL,7,FA government spokesman says: "The right
OL,8,Fto peaceful protest is fundamental to
OL,9,Four democracy, but it must never cross
OL,10,Fa line into disorder"
OL,12,FThe Portsmouth protests followed a
OL,13,Fsimilar protest in Dover on Saturday,
OL,14,Fwhich led to hours of disruption for
OL,15,Ftravellers
OL,17,FIt's thought more than 500 migrants
OL,18,Fcrossed the Channel in small boats
OL,19,Fyesterday - figures will be confirmed
OL,20,Flater by the Home Office
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
